<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto p-8 space-y-6">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></p>

  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains what information Pharma Transport, provided by Thomas
    Information Technology ("Thomas IT," "we," "us," or "our"), collects, how we use it, and
    the choices you have.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">1. Information we collect</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Account and organization information:</strong> name, email address, role, and the organization you create or belong to.</li>
      <li><strong>Operational data you submit:</strong> batch and custody records, vehicle GPS positions, temperature and other sensor readings, uploaded signatures, and documents.</li>
      <li><strong>Billing information:</strong> handled directly by Stripe, our payment processor -- we don't receive or store your card number.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage and log data:</strong> basic technical logs (such as request timestamps) generated by normal operation of the Service.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">2. How we use information</h2>
    <p>
      We use this information to provide and operate the Service: authenticating accounts,
      generating chain-of-custody and Compliance Packet documents from the data you submit,
      displaying fleet and batch status, processing subscription payments, and sending
      account-related email (such as confirmation and password-reset messages). We don't sell
      your data.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">3. Who we share information with</h2>
    <p>
      We share information with the service providers that make the Service work, and
      nobody else: <strong>Stripe</strong> for payment processing and subscription billing,
      and our <strong>email delivery provider</strong> for sending account-related email. We
      may also disclose information if required to do so by law.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain your organization's data for as long as your account is active. If you'd
      like your account and associated data deleted, contact us at the address below.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">5. Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect the information
      you submit, including access controls scoped to your own organization's data. No
      method of transmission or storage is completely secure, and we can't guarantee
      absolute security.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">6. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use a single session cookie required to keep you signed in. We don't use
      advertising or third-party tracking cookies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">7. Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can review and correct your account information at any time while signed in, and
      can request deletion of your account and data by contacting us.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">8. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The Service is intended for business use and is not directed at children. We don't
      knowingly collect information from children.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Continued use of the Service
      after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy, or requests regarding your data, can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:brett@pharmatransport.org" class="text-blue-600 underline">brett@pharmatransport.org</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pt-4">
    See also our <%= link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path, class: "text-blue-600 underline" %>.
  </p>
</div>
